      "title": "How many apples",
      "content": "A: How many apples? B: Five. 问数量用 How many，回答直接说数字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "复数要加 s",
      "content": "问多个东西时，名词后面常加 s：apples, books, cats。只有 1 个时不加：one apple。"
    }
  ],
